{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48442", "qid": "gen-retrieval-023db610", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring Missing transverse momentum (p_T^miss)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define a region requiring Missing transverse momentum (p_T^miss):\n\n- 2004.01678: Preselection region (m_llj < 250 GeV)\n- 2004.04545: Baseline diphoton + b-jet event selection\n- 2006.05880: Control regions CR^Z_VV and CR^Z_ttZ for multi-boson and ttZ background normalisation\n- 2007.02873: 0-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n- 2008.05928: Double-b-tagged signal region (photon + large-R jet)\n- 2009.14537: Preselection region (opposite-charge same-flavor dilepton, Z-veto, low p_T^ll)\n- 2010.14293: MB/BDT-CRgamma (Z(nunu)+jets control region)\n- 2012.01581: Common dijet/SV preselection region (Table 2) and Final signal region (Region H)\n- 2106.01676: On-shell WZ selection signal regions (SR^WZ)\n- 2106.14246: 2ℓSS search regions (SS01–SS20) and Common baseline selection for three-lepton categories (3ℓA–3ℓF)\n- 2107.12553: Baseline preselection common to all signal regions (Table 6) and 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)\n- 2110.11231: Signal region (SR) for WZ trilepton production\n- 2112.03161: Dilepton (DL) channel signal region\n- 2201.11585: γ+jets control region (available only in the MTR category)\n- 2209.07327: Multilepton channel signal region\n- 2304.08962: Signal region (SR): tight vertex, m4mu<11 GeV, ΔR<0.25\n- 2401.05299: 2ℓ SS Signal Region\n- 2404.06204: Detector-level signal region for W -> e nu selection and Detector-level signal region for W -> mu nu selection\n- 2405.18661: H -> gamma gamma fiducial phase space", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "200