{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48442", "qid": "gen-retrieval-0269239d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the generator MadSpin?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the generator MadSpin or related MadGraph5_aMC@NLO configurations:\n\n- **2004.04545**: Used $t\\bar{t}H$/$tH$ NLO signal MC samples (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.6.2 + Pythia 8) and $t\\bar{t}\\gamma\\gamma$ simulated background sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO + Pythia 8, fast simulation).\n- **2006.05880**: Used $t\\bar{t}$ MC sample.\n- **2009.04363**: Used $t\\bar{t}$ background MC sample.\n- **2102.01444**: Used $t\\bar{t}$ MC sample, $t\\bar{t}+V\\ (V=W,Z)$ MC sample, $t\\bar{t}WW$ MC sample, $t\\bar{t}WZ$ MC sample, and $tZ,t\\bar{t}t\\bar{t},t\\bar{t}t$ combined MC sample.\n- **2103.04956**: Used $t\\bar{t}V$ (ttZ, ttWW, ttZZ) MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.4.2 LO background MC sample.\n- **2106.01676**: Used Z+jets MC sample and $t\\bar{t}$ MC sample.\n- **2107.12553**: Used simulated SM $t\\bar{t}$ sample.\n- **2109.13808**: Used $t\\bar{t}$ pair-production sample.\n- **2112.03161**: Used $t\\bar{t}V$ (ttW, ttZ) MC sample and $t\\bar{t}$ production MC sample.\n- **2202.08676**: Used $t\\bar{t}$ MC simulation sample.\n- **2208.12095**: Used $t\\bar{t}V$ MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.3.3 + Pythia 8.210) and $tWZ$ and $tZ$ MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.3.3 + Pythia 8.212).\n- **2209.07327**: Used $t\\bar{t}$ production sample and $t\\bar{t}W$ production sample, and an alternate $t\\bar{t}$ sample for MLP training.\n- **2211.08028**: Used $t\\bar{t}$ background MC sample.\n- **2303.15340**: Used $t\\bar{t}$ MadGraph5_aMC@NLO+Pythia 8.230 sample (matrix-element uncertainty) and $t\\bar{t}H$ MadGraph5_aMC@NLO sample.\n\nThese papers represent a variety of processes and final states, including $t\\bar{t}$, $t\\bar{t}H$, $t\\bar{t}V$, and others, all using MadSpin or MadGraph5_aMC@NLO configurations.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses used the generator MadSpin or related MadGraph5_aMC@NLO configurations:\\n\\n- **2004.04545**: Used $t\\\\bar{t}H$", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "MadSpin", "kind": "generator"}, "rows": 46, "error": null, "seconds": 0.099}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "sample_uses_generator", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 233, "error": null, "seconds": 0.069}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:vvv", "hepkg:sample:zjets", "hepkg:sample:tWZ_tZ_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:twz", "hepkg:sample:tz-mg5", "hepkg:sample:tz", "hepkg:sample:tZ-tttt-ttt-mc", "hepkg:sample:ttbar-mc", "hepkg:sample:ttbar_mg5_amcnlo_pythia8", "hepkg:sample:ttbar", "hepkg:sample:ttbarV-mc", "hepkg:sample:tth_mg5_amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:tth_th_signal_nlo", "hepkg:sample:ttV_madgraph", "hepkg:sample:ttv", "hepkg:sample:ttW", "hepkg:sample:ttw_ttz_mg5_pythia8", "hepkg:sample:ttWW-mc", "hepkg:sample:rare-mg5", "hepkg:sample:ttWZ-mc", "hepkg:sample:ttZ_signal", "hepkg:sample:ttyy_background", "hepkg:sample:tttt-m