{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48442", "qid": "gen-retrieval-0676d21c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty Pile-up modelling uncertainty?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses report the systematic uncertainty \"Pile-up modelling uncertainty\":\n\n- 2009.04363: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- 2111.08340: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector\n- 2208.12095: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- 2309.14442: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b} \\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- 2402.08486: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- 2504.13081: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- 2508.13900: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- 2510.07527: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- 2602.18611: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- 2604.21670: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark\n- 2604.27044: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( b \\) final state\n- 2605.14245: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the \\( \\gamma\\gamma \\) final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n\nThese are the distinct papers that report the systematic uncertainty \"Pile-up modelling uncertainty\".\n\nAnswer: The graph contains 12 distinct analyses that report the systematic uncertainty \"Pile-up modelling uncertainty\".\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses report the systematic uncertainty 'Pile-up modelling uncertainty':\\n\\n- 2009.04363: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\\n- 2111.08340: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b} \\\\) decays in the ATLAS detector\\n- 2208.12095: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\\\rightarrow t\\\\bar{t} \\\\) production at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=13 \\\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\\n- 2309.14442: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\( t\\\\bar{t}b\\\\bar{b} \\\\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\( \\\\sqrt{s}=1", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Pile-up modelling uncertainty", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"