{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48442", "qid": "gen-retrieval-06776590", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured |Δφ| between leading extra light jet and softest b jet?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured observables related to the |Δφ| between the leading extra light jet and the softest b jet:\n\n1. **2309.14442**: \"Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of ${{\\mathup{{{t}}}}{}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{t}}}}}}}}}{{\\mathup{{{b}}}}}{\\mathup{{\\overline{{{\\mathup{{{b}}}}}}}}}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n2. **2402.08486**: \"Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n3. **2404.06204**: \"Compatibility test (chi2/dof) between p_T^Z measured via p_T^ll and via u_T\"\n4. **2504.13081**: \"Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n\nThese papers cover various aspects of the observables, including differential cross sections and compatibility tests. If you need more detailed information on specific observables or methods used in these analyses, please let me know.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2103.04956", "2110.11231", "2307.01094", "2309.14442", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2504.13081"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "|Δφ| between leading extra light jet and softest b jet", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 48, "error": null, "seconds": 0.221}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_ob