{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48442", "qid": "gen-retrieval-06f0fe7f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using Data-to-simulation scale factor derived in a control region?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate a background using a data-to-simulation scale factor derived in a control region:\n\n- **2004.14060**: Estimates $Z\\to\\nu\\bar{\\nu}$ + heavy-flavour jets, $t\\bar{t}$, and $W$+jets backgrounds.\n- **2007.02873**: Estimates Z+jets background.\n- **2010.14293**: Estimates Z+jets and W+jets backgrounds.\n- **2012.03799**: Estimates ttbar (semileptonic/dileptonic), W+jets, and Z+jets backgrounds.\n- **2102.01444**: Estimates $t\\bar{t}$, $Wt$ single-top, Z+jets, and \"Others\" minor background categories.\n- **2106.01676**: Uses Z+jets MC sample, estimates SM WZ, ttbar, and Z+jets (FNP-lepton) backgrounds.\n- **2109.13808**: Estimates Drell-Yan Z/gamma*+jets and non-resonant WW diboson backgrounds.\n- **2202.08676**: Estimates WZ irreducible background.\n- **2208.12095**: Estimates $W{+}\\text{jets}$ and $Z{+}\\text{jets}$ backgrounds.\n- **2211.08028**: Estimates $t\\bar{t}$, W+jets, and Z+jets backgrounds.\n\nThese papers cover a range of backgrounds, including $Z$+jets, $W$+jets, $t\\bar{t}$, and others, using data-to-simulation scale factors derived in control regions.\n\nAnswered from the graph, the information is supported by the retrieved rows.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses estimate a background using a data-to-simulation scale factor derived in a control region:\\n\\n- **2004.14060**: Estimates $Z\\\\to\\\\nu\\\\bar{\\\\nu}$ + heavy-flavour jets, $t\\\\bar{t}$, and $W$+jets backgrounds.\\n- **2007.02873**: Estimates Z+jets background.\\n- **2010.14293**: Estimates Z+jets and W+jets backgrounds.\\n- **