{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48442", "qid": "gen-retrieval-096badf9", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Absolute value of the Higgs boson rapidity (|y_H|)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses measured the absolute value of the Higgs boson rapidity (|y_H|):\n\n1. **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n2. **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n3. **2401.05299**: \"Absolute differential cross-section vs $H_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\mathrm{jet}}$ result\"\n4. **2401.05299**: \"Absolute differential cross-section vs $H_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\mathrm{lep}}$ result\"\n5. **2402.08486**: \"Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n6. **2504.13081**: \"Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n7. **2510.07527**: \"Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n8. **2602.18611**: \"Effective coupling modifier fit with B_inv, B_undet floating and |kappa_V|<=1 constraint\"\n9. **2602.18611**: \"Coupling modifier ratio fit\"\n10. **2604.21670**: \"Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark\"\n\nThese papers cover a range of measurements related to the Higgs boson, including differential cross sections, signal strengths, and effective coupling modifiers.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2009.04363", "2012.01581", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2407.10549", "2504.13081", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Absolute value of the Higgs boson rapidity (|y_H|)", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.195}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 76, "error": null, "seconds": 0.049}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:diff-htjet-abs", "hepkg:result:diff-htlep-abs", "hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450", "hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:coupling_modifier_ratios", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:coupling_effective_binv_kv1", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f"]}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:observable:abs_deta_jj", "hepkg:observable:abs_y_h", "hepkg:observable:br_h_to_inv", "hepkg:observable:bsm_branching_fraction_invisible", "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_ratio", "hepkg:observable:deltaR_bbadd", "hepkg:observable:deltaR_bbextra", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-htjet-abs", "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-htlep-abs", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_pt_h", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_y_h", "hepkg:observable:eta_bbadd", "hepkg:observable:eta_bbextra", "hepkg:observable:eta_ll_abs", "hepkg:observable:fit_basis_linear_with_dihiggs", "hepkg:observable:hh_incl_signal_strength", "hepkg:observable:higgs_br_ul", "hepkg:observable:higgs_branching_fraction_ratio", "hepkg:observable:higgs_mass_profiled", "hepkg:observable:higgs_signal_st