{"run_id": "20260814T133731-hepkg-48442", "qid": "gen-retrieval-0a086b6a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "9f0ca51b332d", "git_sha": "feb9060-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the generator PYTHIA 6?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the generator PYTHIA 6:\n\n- **2004.14060**: Analysis involving the $tWZ$, $tZ$ background MC sample.\n- **2106.01676**: Analysis involving the Z+jets MC sample.\n- **2109.13808**: Analysis involving the Single-top Wt production sample.\n- **2208.12095**: Analysis involving the $tWZ$ and $tZ$ MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.3.3 + Pythia 8.212).\n- **2303.15340**: Analysis involving the $Wt$ Powheg+Pythia 8.230 sample (diagram removal and diagram subtraction interference schemes).\n- **2401.05299**: Analysis involving the $tZ$ sample (MG5_aMC LO + Pythia 8).\n- **2407.10549**: Analysis involving the $Vh$ associated production background sample (Powheg Box + Pythia 8.186).\n- **2503.19420**: Analysis involving multiple samples including $q\\bar{q}\\to WH$, $q\\bar{q}\\to ZH$, $gg\\to ZH$, Z+jets, $VVV$ triboson, $Wt$, $tZ$, and $tWZ$.\n- **2508.13900**: Analysis involving the Z/gamma*+jets background sample (Z+jets and Drell-Yan).\n- **2509.22535**: Analysis involving the $tWZ$ MC sample.\n\nThese are the distinct papers that used the generator PYTHIA 6 in their analyses.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses used the generator PYTHIA 6:\\n\\n- **2004.14060**: Analysis involving the $tWZ$, $tZ$ background MC sample.\\n- **2106.01676**: Analysis involving the Z+jets MC sample.\\n- **2109.13808**: Analysis involving the Single-top Wt production sample.\\n- **2208.12095**: Analysis involving the $tWZ$ and $tZ$ MC sample (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO 2.3.3 + Pythia 8.212).\\n- **2303.15340**: Analysis involving the $Wt$ Powheg+Pythia 8.230 sample (diagram removal and diagram subtraction interference schemes).\\n- **2401.05299**: Analysis involving the $tZ$ sample (MG5_aMC LO + Pythia 8).\\n- **2407.10549**: Analysis involving the $Vh$ associated production background sample (Powheg Box + Pythia 8.186).\\n- **2503.19420**: Analysis involving multiple samples including $q\\\\bar{q}\\\\to WH$, $q\\\\bar{q}\\\\to ZH$, $gg\\\\to ZH$, Z+jets, $VVV$ triboson, $Wt$, $tZ$, and $tWZ$.\\n- **2508.13900**: Analysis involving the Z/gamma*+jets background sample (Z+jets and Drell-Yan).\\n- **", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "PYTHIA 6", "kind": "generator"}, "rows": 50, "error": null, "seconds": 0.116}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "sample_uses_generator", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 560, "error": null, "seconds": 0.069}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:vvv", "hepkg:sample:vh-powheg-pythia", "hepkg:sample:wt_powheg_pythia8_diagram_removal", "hepkg:sample:wt_powheg_pythia8_diagram_subtraction", "hepkg:sample:wt", "hepkg:sample:zjets", "hepkg:sample:gg-zh", "hepkg:sample:qq-wh", "hepkg:sample:qq-zh", "hep